## World Forge kit table: short names (`kit:pine`) for existing scenes, plus the built-in procedural pieces
## (`forge:wall` via the `wall` statement, `forge:brazier`, `forge:stake`). Any `res://...tscn` path works too.
## No class_name on purpose (preloaded tool script).

